# Build outputs and the third-party Gradle wrapper binary are not committed (the
# repository does not commit third-party binaries), matching the spike fixture's
# rule and the Maven fixture's ignored `target/`. Before a driven run:
#
#   gradle wrapper --gradle-version 9.5.1
#   ./gradlew classes
#
# Both are prerequisites, not conveniences. `gradlew` is what the run/debug
# generator is expected to select over the bare `gradle`, and Modulith metadata
# generation runs against compiled classes.
.gradle/
build/
gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
